<p><strong><%= @user.email_address %></strong> just signed up as “<%= @account.name %>”.</p>
<p>The account is already approved and has a “Production” source waiting on its Setup page. Nothing to do unless it looks like abuse:</p>
<p><%= link_to "View account", @account_url %></p>
<p style="color: #71717a; font-size: 14px;">Suspending from that page hides the app behind a “paused” notice and makes the account's webhooks return 404 right away; you can restore it from the same page. This link works for 30 days; after that, use the console.</p>
